{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bad30f3897171ec5e9ac2de65f1252aac63cd532dc72c9d14cb0a12e736af530",
      "text": "……哎呀？\n不知为何人开始聚集起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfacd3c5655e74e5318a6ae5d49edbf5e1c7f863477cca0fa78a62c67e000eb",
      "text": "嘿～是新人偶像的招募呢！\n你要不要去试试看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed3aa7aac056b8fe3ad1420e9e8de5ba08d52b9f71f78c0c0ae1f64e3dae9c6a",
      "text": "别闹了，我怎么可能当偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5acfcd79895b736fa0cafd9b48cab4fcb32530a7d47851ec9f2413db6e666cc3",
      "text": "难以置信。学生们居然被您张贴的海报\n给吸引得目不转睛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cd0448a198e2afd0cdbdbb36f468117fbdebaa5fae465156ee0a75aeb9f61ee",
      "text": "太好了。说实话，我还担心万一\n根本没人看该怎么办呢……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f278c4ed33cd4e755cba9047cb43ec5de9b73e6c5b79b85fed48c12ed810bf",
      "text": "呵呵。\n……话说回来，偶像，是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2250a9004b4d30ec849204ac01699d1e480f4f2dcda338bdd8cb449d7977efcd",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。\n我还没做自我介绍呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdc61933939253ad079636f56d24e12d6136c191e39a7e8c6a6369016822df9c",
      "text": "其实我是一家名叫315 Production的\n偶像事务所的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d4b482e8d8041c398fa26b143a901af0281903a46e4991f88d6d5845e80715",
      "text": "这一次，为了招募事务所的新偶像，\n才在这所大学里张贴举办试镜的海报……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f5805418f67d4101754a113278382ba6a5460d934d039653d36ac4cb4979b25",
      "text": "诶，偶像的制作人！？\n难道说，就是所谓的业界人士吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
